ch aso-oke and damask. In the Americas, explore the enduring indigenous weaving of Peru's striped wool <a href={garmentMap.get('poncho')} class="underline font-medium text-ink hover:text-primary">ponchos</a> in <a href={countryMap.get('peru')} class="underline font-medium text-ink hover:text-primary">Peru</a> and Mexico's mastercrafted <a href={garmentMap.get('sarape')} class="underline font-medium text-ink hover:text-primary">sarapes</a> in <a href={countryMap.get('mexico')} class="underline font-medium text-ink hover:text-primary">Mexico</a>. By categorizing <strong>traditional clothing by country</strong>, our explorer enables cross-cultural comparisons and deep regional understanding.
